Package: qore-xmlsec-module
Architecture: any
Depends: ${qore:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: qore-xmlsec-module-doc
Description: XML signatures and encryption module for Qore
 This module signs, verifies, encrypts and decrypts XML documents using
 the distribution XML Security Library and its OpenSSL backend.
 Native compiler metadata is included for Qore's tools.

Package: qore-xmlsec-module-doc
Section: doc
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Build-Profiles: <!nodoc>
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: qore-xmlsec-module
Description: documentation and examples for Qore's xmlsec module
 This package contains the HTML API reference, example tests and public
 test certificates/keys for Qore's XML Security module.
